# Route: guide 4 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Gnome (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 16 to 21, 67
# quests, 5.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Darkshore): Auberdine -> Ameth'Aran -> Auberdine -> Bashal'Aran ->
# Tower of Althalaxx -> Cliffspring River -> Auberdine -> Ameth'Aran -> Grove
# of the Ancients -> The Master's Glaive -> Auberdine -> Bashal'Aran ->
# Cliffspring River -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Baron Marinous (98028; Baron
# Marinous 21).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 1579 Gaffer
# Jacks; 1580 Electropellers; 2178 Easy Strider Living.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

